dentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI15CommandsBuilderV","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/CommandsBuilder","text":"CommandsBuilder","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"content","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Commands","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI8CommandsP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Commands"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"content","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Commands"},{"type":"text","text":" builder whose output will be used to replace"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the commands normally provided by the modified scene."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that replaces any commands defined by its children"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with alternative content."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WindowGroup"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Window"},{"type":"text","text":", and other scene types all have an associated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set of commands that they include by default. Apply this modifier to a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scene to replace those commands with the output from the given builder."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, the following code adds a scene for showing the contents of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the pasteboard in a dedicated window. We replace the scene’s default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Window > Clipboard menu command with a custom Edit > Show Clipboard"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"command that we place next to the other pasteboard commands."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@main","struct Example: App {","    @Environment(\\.openWindow) var openWindow","","    var body: some Scene {","        ...","","        Window(\"Clipboard\", id: \"clipboard\") {","            ClipboardContentView()","        }","        .commandsReplaced {","            CommandGroup(after: .pasteboard) {","                Section {","                    Button(\"Show Clipboard\") {","                        openWindow(id: \"clipboard\")","                    }","                }","            }","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/UtilityWindow/commandsReplaced(content:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Replaces all commands defined by the modified scene with the commands"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the builder."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow\/commandsReplaced(content:)","title":"commandsReplaced(content:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"commandsReplaced"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Content"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"content"},{"kind":"text","text":": () ->